{"id":430,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"One cry from this Pokémon, and a murder of Murkrow come flying. At such times, one would think the curtain of night had fallen, plunging the world into jet-black darkness."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It will absolutely not forgive failure from or betrayal by its goons. It has no choice in this if it wants to maintain the order of the flock."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"If its Murkrow cronies fail to catch food for it, or if it feels they have betrayed it, it will hunt them down wherever they are and punish them."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"A single cry from this nocturnal Pokémon, and more than a hundred of its Murkrow cronies will assemble."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It is merciless by nature. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its MURKROW followers."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It makes its MURKROW cronies bring it food. It idles its time away, grooming itself in its nest."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."},{"name":"Moxie","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon knocks out a target, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Black","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":198,"name":"Murkrow","condition":null,"children":[{"id":430,"name":"Honchkrow","condition":"Use Dusk Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,17],[1,114],[1,310],[1,389],[1,400],[1,511],[25,207],[35,417],[45,492],[55,399],[65,894]],"machine":[512,332,314,403,413,347,886,109,399,38,814,283,203,263,297,19,492,416,114,257,270,506,542,63,196,808,189,417,101,182,244,94,917,240,156,184,247,214,555,180,164,241,366,36,269,851,168,86,369,253],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-127","name":"Team Rocket's Honchkrow","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Rare","number":"127","artist":"hncl","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-127/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-127/large"},{"id":"me2-58","name":"Honchkrow","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"58","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","img":"me2/58"},{"id":"sv2-132","name":"Honchkrow","set":"Paldea Evolved","date":"2023-06-09","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"132","artist":"Nisota Niso","img":"sv2/132"},{"id":"swsh12-107","name":"Honchkrow","set":"Silver Tempest","date":"2022-11-11","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"107","artist":"aoki","img":"swsh12/107"},{"id":"swsh11-115","name":"Honchkrow","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare","number":"115","artist":"Shiburingaru","img":"swsh11/115"},{"id":"swsh9-88","name":"Honchkrow V","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"88","artist":"PLANETA Mochizuki","img":"swsh9/88"},{"id":"swsh9-161","name":"Honchkrow V","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Rare Ultra","number":"161","artist":"PLANETA Mochizuki","img":"swsh9/161"},{"id":"swsh9-162","name":"Honchkrow V","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Rare Ultra","number":"162","artist":"zig","img":"swsh9/162"},{"id":"swsh5-94","name":"Honchkrow","set":"Battle Styles","date":"2021-03-19","rarity":"Uncommon","n